<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">Juda</book>
  <para style="h">Juda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Juda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Juda</para>
  <para style="mt">Juda</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei Jesu Khrist suohpa leh Jakob sanggampa Juda in, Pa Pasian hatte, akoituomte leh Jesu Khrist a kepbitte kungah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khotuona lungmuonna leh itna, na kung uah suhpungin umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka itte aw, i tankhawm uh hundamna thu na kung ua, gel kaal ka ngahla mama laitahin, misiengthoute kunga khatvei a setden dinga kipekhie thugin hum a phatuomngai tah a na pan na ding ua, hanthawn na thu hing gel poimaw kasa zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen nidanglai akipata siemlou tang dinga guotsa, Pasian ngaisahlou leh, i Pasian uh hepina khu huasanna suohsah a, tualeh i Mangpa Pasian umsun nuol in, i Mangpa Jesu Khrist gingtalou, mi koite ahiei, theiloukaal a simtham a hinglut a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa’n Izipt gam akipat amite hundoh zouta napi in, anua a agingta loute asumangthang hi, chi na theisa uh hinanleh, ka hing thei thasah kia nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh ahina dinmun masa uh kemden loua, a umna mun uh taisan vansawltahte zong, tua ni thupi a gawt dingin miellah ah akoi a, kumtawn khainiengin akaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuamabangin Sodom leh Gomorrah leh akim avel a um khuote numei pasal kaal a thangtatnate a kipumpieh leh tahsatuom dang na delte khu, kumtawn mei a gawtna thuoh dingte etsahna in anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuamabangin, tam mang kidahhuoi manten zong, tahsa asubua ua, thuneina adei sih ua, thupinate agensie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Mikael, vansawlsieng Tungnungpen hilhiel in zong dawimangpa toh Mosi luong akitu a diabol toh akihau lai un ama agense ngam sih a, “Mangpa’n hing phawh heh” achi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh tam mite penin, atheiloute uh agensie ua, ngaituona neilou gamsate banga pienken theitheina a, atheite uh abawl ua, ama u’leh ama uh akisusie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atunguh agih hi, Kain lampi azui ziehun, Punna deigawnain Balaam suhkhelna ah kilawptahin atailut ua, tualeh Korah helna ah amangthaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam mite pen na itna ankuong luina ua mai ngaltah a na kung ua annkuong a imkhawm chieng un, tuiin atup suongmong hiem, zaunadan theilou a, amauh kivate ahi uhi, amaute khu, tui pailou meilum hui mutleengte leh khaal lai a, ga neilou singkung vuoi, ga neilou nivei shita, azunga kiphungkalte, ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaute pen, ama uh zumna tuipi kinawh ziazuate leh aasi vahvai leeng kawikawite, bang ahi ua, ama-ua ding a Pasian in kumtawn a dinga mielna vomkeikui akoipiehte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Adam a kipata akhang sagina Enok in zong tamte tungtang ana genlawh hi, “En un, Mangpa khu Amisiengthou tul sawmte toh ahing pei hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi zousie tunga thu akhen ding leh, alah ua Pasian ngaisah loute nasep zousie siemlou atangsah dinga, Pasian ngainatna neilou mikhielte, Pasian ngaisahloutaha agamtatnate u’leh agensietnate uah siemmaw tangsah ding in achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam mite pen phunhatte, mi demna ding suite leh ama uh tahsa utna bangbanga gamtate ahi uhi, kam kisatheitah a amaute phattuomna ding gen a mi maitangphatte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh ka itte aw, nouten vang i Mangpa Jesu Khrist sawltahten ni danglai a, ana thugente uh thei ngitnget un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hun nukhia chiengin pasien ngaisahlouna lam a amauh utna banga um, mi simmaw hatte ahing um ding uh,” ana chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam mite pen, kituombawl hatte, tahsa mi, hagau neiloute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh ka itte aw, noute pen, a siengthou penpen na thugin uh tunga kilamtouin, Hagau Siengthou ah thum un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumtawn hinna hing tut ding i Mangpa Jesu Khrist hepina ngah kawmin, Pasian itna ah kikem det un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aginglel pawlkhatte tungah lainatna nei unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Midangte zong meikuonga pat kaidoh unlen, hunkhie unlen, atahsa un asuhbua apuonsilte uh nangawn kidah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuin, na kipalpua louna ding ua, hing vengbit thei leh, athupina mai a nasatah a nuomsa a, gensietbei a noute hing koi theipa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I hundampa uh Pasian apil umsun Ama kungah, thupina leh pahtawinate vaihawmna leh silbawltheina, Tu leh tangtawn in umdenta hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
